----
id: public_forum
----
## A public forum on AI

In May 2026, we opened a public forum on the *Impact of AI on work* to all Californians. In the months to follow, thousands of people across the state gave us their thoughts. They took our survey and joined facilitated group discussions. They shared their own experiences, and listened to their peers. Then they refined gut reactions into concrete policy ideas.

One idea came up consistently: **We need humans in the AI policy loop.** Not only for how people use AI, but for how companies build it and laws govern it.
