id: ranking
----
### From discussions

Then we refined AI policy ideas in 2-hour discussions. We grouped what people said there into 26 distinct themes.

Then we ranked them according to:

- How often an idea came up across discussions (frequency), and
- How much support it drew when it did (how often it was a popular idea).

That ranking sorted the themes into these three tiers:
