id: how_we_did_this_work
title: How we did this work
translator_note: "The button links to the page with the full methods."
button_text: See the details
button_href: /ai-impact/report-details/
----
Our engagement had two phases: an open online survey, then live discussions with a smaller group of respondents. We chose that group by sortition, a lottery-style method that balances the invitee list against California’s demographics while giving everyone who qualifies an equal chance. The details page explains how we set those targets, how close each phase came to them, and how we analyzed what people said.
